{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/4867961/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータリング争奪バトル ランチ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミドルチーム\n美味しそうなパスタ\n食べれませんでした..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スパボー...\n美味しかったです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも乃木坂を年齢順で3つに割ると\nギリでミドルチームになった事が\nすごく嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アダルトチームに入ると思ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/4867961/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/4867961/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46国民投票ダービー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元々出る予定じゃなかったから\n告知はできなかったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急遽\n出させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映らなかったかもしれないけど\nガヤりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/4867961/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の声ちょっとは聞こえたかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/4867961/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが私の冠番組「乃木坂電視台 ～それぞれの椅子～」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に\nナカダリズムやりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/4867961/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インストラクター風に！本格的に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の振付ちょっとずついれたけど\nわかったかなあ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/4867961/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなちゃんとやってくれた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/4867961/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータリング争奪バトル ディナー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"並 ですが\n寿司獲得しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/4867961/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スパボーでとても悲しかったから\n本当に嬉しかったよ(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ランチもディナーも\nみんなと回答はあわなかったけど\nひめたんとやたらあってて\n嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/11/4867961/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レポが追いつかなくなりそうなくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も盛りだくさんだねえ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}